error[K0041]: cannot enter @strict block - value has active aliases
  --> tests\ui\strict_k0043_moved_binding.kobo:6:9
  |
3 |     let alias = data.clone();
  |                 ------------ alias created here
6 |         consume(data);
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ active aliases at @strict block entry
6 |         consume(data);
  |                   ---- alias created here
  |
why: value has 2 active aliases when the @strict block starts; all aliases must end before the boundary is entered
fix: drop or explicitly clone-then-drop aliases before the @strict { } boundary
error[K0043]: value moved inside @strict block - cannot restore on exit
  --> tests\ui\strict_k0043_moved_binding.kobo:6:19
  |
6 |         consume(data);
  |         -------------- @strict block
6 |         consume(data);
  |                   ^^^^ value moved here
  |
why: a binding is moved inside an @strict block; the boundary guard is dropped on exit from the block and the moved value cannot be restored to its outer ownership shape
fix: clone the value before moving, or drop the guard before the move statement
